1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:09,453
Now the boiling point puzzle, with all seven isomers of C four H ten O, plus pentane, an alkane of almost the same mass.

2
00:00:09,453 --> 00:00:14,361
The four alcohols boil between eighty two and one hundred and eighteen degrees.

3
00:00:14,361 --> 00:00:18,320
The three ethers all boil between thirty and thirty nine.

4
00:00:18,320 --> 00:00:22,812
And the ethers sit right next to pentane, which has no oxygen at all.

